  "bank": "Reuse exact ranked_v1 104 physical policies, source-only proposal ranking, coordinates and provenance. Original73 prefix, round1 release89 and round2 release104. No regenerated proposals, reranking or task-dependent feasibility filtering.",
  "representation": "Reuse identical frozen d1000 mean4/risk10 coordinates: controls and observable descriptors are geometry-independent. Jointly fit existing g directions and residual public mean4 directions using the same48 allowed source records; restore the two fitted native g identities and their source-evidence identity weights before initialization. No previous independent residual correction is added. Geometry parameters and target outcomes do not enter source fitting or representation.",
