  "endpoints": "Four-arm actual certified safe reward and false certificates, paired by unseen task geometry. Score unsampled f/g/logvariance errors against each task own truth, plus terminal-only marginal interventions and their task-specific conditional safe reward. After all16 verifiers complete, report each task feasible-bank count and best feasible quality for original73/generated31/union104 separately. Keep empty feasible banks and failed certificates; never replace tasks based on outcomes.",
  "randomness": "Task geometry seed2026101561 draws each shift coordinate independently from Uniform(-.035,.035) and radius scale from Uniform(.95,1.05), using the existing task_configs order. Initialization/search/verification/bootstrap use fresh seeds1562/1563/1564/1565. Draw two fresh initialization episodes per task and share them across its four arms. Search uses paired common random numbers for equal task/round/query; verification streams are paired within task and independent of search. No cached target observations are reused.",
